{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110103001:1":{"text":"マスターの名を汚す奴は、護衛騎士であるこのロンロンが――","source_cn":"主人的名誉，不可侵犯！贴身护卫的骑士满满——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53EF24341307668F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターの名を汚す奴は、護衛騎士であるこのロンロンが――","female":"マスターの名を汚す奴は、護衛騎士であるこのロンロンが――","variant_male_record_index":"121185","variant_female_record_index":"121186","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110103002:1":{"text":"キミは……騎士なの？","source_cn":"你是……骑士？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7909D135AED12E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110103003:0":{"text":"ふふん、そうです！……って突然なんなんですかあなたは！？","source_cn":"哼哼，当然！等等！突然冒出来搭话……你是什么东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B35EA486BD76932","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110103004:0":{"text":"見て分かるだろ？ボクはハムスターの使い魔だよ！宝探しハムスターのラージさ！","source_cn":"不明显吗？我当然是仓鼠使魔！寻宝仓鼠拉奇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48AEC0FEAA5CDF85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110103004":{"text":"見て分かるだろ？ボクはハムスターの使い魔だよ！宝探しハムスターのラージさ！","source_cn":"不明显吗？我当然是仓鼠使魔！寻宝仓鼠拉奇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48AEC0FEAA5CDF85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110103006:0":{"text":"んん？ボクみたいな宝探しハムスターを見るのは初めてかい？","source_cn":"咦？你们没有在别的地方见过我这样的寻宝仓鼠吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8B104A31E2EA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110103007:1":{"text":"ボクのマスターもメイジなんだ。ここにはマスターの命令でお宝を探しに来たんだよ！","source_cn":"我的主人也是魔法师，我就是被主人派来沙漠寻宝的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8DCA96B114FB306E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ボクのマスターもメイジなんだ。ここにはマスターの命令でお宝を探しに来たんだよ！","female":"ボクのマスターもメイジなんだ。ここにはマスターの命令でお宝を探しに来たんだよ！","variant_male_record_index":"121193","variant_female_record_index":"121194","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110103008:1":{"text":"てっきりキミたちも宝探しハムスターだと思ったんだ。だから先を越されないように、道案内は絶対に断ろうと思ったんだけど……","source_cn":"一开始，我以为两位也是寻宝仓鼠来着，还想着绝对不能给你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75B18A4BF4008B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110103008":{"text":"てっきりキミたちも宝探しハムスターだと思ったんだ。だから先を越されないように、道案内は絶対に断ろうと思ったんだけど……","source_cn":"一开始，我以为两位也是寻宝仓鼠来着，还想着绝对不能给你们指路，免得你们先一步拿走宝物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75B18A4BF4008B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110103009:0":{"text":"私たちはお宝に用はありません。なので、道案内をお願いできますか？","source_cn":"我们不是来寻宝的。可以请你为我们指路吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB1B34DFA7FF1487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110103010:1":{"text":"私たち人を探してるんです。だから、集落やオアシスで情報を集めたくて……案内をしてくれるならすごく助かります！","source_cn":"你要是能给我们指路就太好了！其实我们是来找人的，需要找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1387039A11F0D746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110103011:0":{"text":"よしきた！確かボクがお宝を探してるルートの近くにそういう場所があったはずだよ！","source_cn":"那你们问对鼠了！我的寻宝路线附近，确实有类似的地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27FA01CDE3C6D004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110103012:0":{"text":"この道に沿って行けば着くよ！あそこは宝探しでも通る場所だから、どこかでまた会えるかもね！それじゃ！","source_cn":"只要沿着这条路前进，就能看到啦。那也是我的寻宝必经之地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC55882EB169D071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"僕たちは宝を探しに来たんじゃない。","source_cn":"我们不是来寻宝的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC97981FB7B5F1815","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"僕たちは宝を探しに来たんじゃない。","female":"私たちは宝を探しに来たんじゃないの。","variant_male_record_index":"63236","variant_female_record_index":"63237","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"確かに道案内が必要だ。","sour